/p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      As a beginner level graphics card, ROG STRIX GeForce RTX 4060 OC Edition is the strongest 4060 graphic card but it is most expensive too.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>HONG KONG</span> <span>07/02/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix GeForce RTX™ 4060 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 Media review Award of HKEPC Innovative Design\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hkepc.com/21561/%E5%85%85%E5%A0%B4%E9%9D%A2__%E5%8B%81%E4%BC%BC_RTX_4090_ASUS_ROG_STRIX_GeForce_RTX_4060_OC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/202307042228285220834.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Innovation Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Overclocking.com\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Innovation Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      With this RTX 4060, which is the most affordable card in the ADA Lovelace architecture, NVIDIA is offering us the best chip in years in terms of power consumption. In terms of performance, it's 20% more efficient than the previous generation and supports DLSS3, which will help you gain FPS and make your game smoother.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>06/29/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix GeForce RTX™ 4060 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 Media review Award of Innovation Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://overclocking.com/test-rog-strix-geforce-rtx-4060-oc-edition/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202404172210149360521.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Best of 2023 Gold\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Techtesters.eu\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Best of 2023 Gold</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      This generation, the ASUS ROG Strix wins quite convincingly with better efficiency...\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>03/04/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix GeForce RTX™ 4060 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 Media review Award of Best of 2023 Gold\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.techtesters.eu/techtesters-best-of-2023-awards-componenten/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\"